notes: 'JCM181 explicitly names Hipolypepton(FUJIFILMWako). OfficialWako catalog identifies
  unsuffixedHIPOLYPEPTON as a dried purified enzymatic casein hydrolysate, manufactured
  byNihonPharmaceutical, listedas392-02115 for500g. S/N/NS variants are soybean products
  and excluded. The source recipe doesnot give catalogcode/lot, so current catalog
  is product-family corroboration, not exact historical lot equivalence. The baselinePolypeptone
  casein+soy claim is contradicted and must not absorb this source. No intact-casein
  constituent, peptide inventory or quantitative composition is asserted. Raw labels
  retained as occurrence provenance only: [''Hipolypepton (FUJIFILM Wako)''].'
